{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的高亮意群单独扫也能串出离开的缘由、旧日归属、反复犹豫和继续前行；Y 的大块较多是抽象状态概括。small：X 的补充大多能接住当屏处境，Y 的旁注虽有信息量，但偏向音乐说明；core：X 更完整地写出为不再受委屈而离开、又舍不得曾被当作自己人的生活，最后带着想念继续往前。concise：X 虽然文字较多，但各屏大多推进了新的情境；Y 对不安、无着落、守住尊严和不撤回选择有较多重复表达。human：X 的“心里酸了”“受过的气”“把那些委屈咽下去”等符合日常口语；Y 的“把握散开”“没有变成一个明确结果”“维护尊严”等偏抽象书面。fine：Y 把观众的身体和心理体验集中放在感受部分，音乐描写另作旁注，区分更清楚；X 的感受中有不少直接描述和弦、旋律和步态。load：X 的大字多为较短的自然意群，Y 的大块长句较多，尤其 S01—S07，扫读负担更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "633e4dca-0fd4-479f-aee0-c2dcb5698a3d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T124528977346Z", "elapsed_seconds": 439.171, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T12:52:48.175388+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b0626938284f7742435d79373803d612418c763c0cccf6329b5eb085befe24d9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4